    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">Spain Visa Renewal Timeline: When to Start and What to Expect</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">Spain visa renewals have firm deadlines — and the bureaucratic process can move more slowly than expected. Leaving renewal too late is one of the most common and avoidable mistakes. This guide gives you a concrete planning timeline so you're never caught out.</p>
  </div>
